<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<animated-vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:aapt="http://schemas.android.com/aapt">
    <!--
      Aurum's OS-level animated splash icon. Timeline, stage count, group
      nesting, durations, offsets and easings are copied directly from
      Echo Nightly's own art_splash_anim.xml (2400ms total, wrapper at
      0.6 scale, bg/ring/note_group/note four independently-timed
      targets) - only the actual shapes are Aurum's own, traced from the
      real logo PNG (36039.png). See art_splash_anim.xml (the static
      version) for the trace/extraction method.

      DELIBERATE DIFFERENCE FROM ECHO: Echo's own "note" target morphs
      away from its play-triangle and then, at 1600ms, morphs BACK to
      the play-triangle (so Echo's splash ends on the same icon it
      started with - a decorative wobble, not a reveal). That reverse
      morph is dropped here on purpose: the whole point of this splash
      is to end on Aurum's real note, not snap back to the placeholder
      triangle. Echo's "path_5"/"path_6" - two tiny decorative accent
      marks specific to Echo's own play-icone artwork with no
      equivalent in Aurum's logo - are dropped for the same reason:
      they have nothing to attach to here.

      Morph safety: the play-triangle below is NOT Echo's curved
      triangle pathData - it's a from-scratch 19-point straight-line
      polygon (M + 19 L's + Z) built to have the exact same command
      count and type as Aurum's real note shape (also M + 19 L's + Z),
      with each point manually corresponded to its counterpart on the
      note. Verified by rendering interpolated in-between frames before
      use - no self-intersection or zigzag.

      TWO REAL BUGS FIXED after seeing this fail on a physical device:
      1) Timeline was 2400ms total, but Android hard-caps
         windowSplashScreenAnimationDuration at 1000ms (device screenshot
         confirmed the icon just sat static/blank — most of this
         timeline was being truncated before it could run). Every
         duration and startOffset below has been rescaled by 0.375x
         (900/2400) so the full sequence now finishes inside 900ms,
         matching styles.xml's windowSplashScreenAnimationDuration=900.
      2) note's fillColor was #16191C (near-black) against this app's
         #050508 (near-black) splash background — zero contrast, so the
         icon was invisible even during the sliver of time it did run.
         Changed to white (#FFFFFF), matching the real logo's actual
         white note in scallop_ring.png. (Echo's own #1d1d1b works fine
         for them only because Echo's splash background resolves to
         white, not black - opposite contrast situation.)
    -->
    <aapt:attr name="android:drawable">
        <vector
            android:name="vector"
            android:width="24dp"
            android:height="24dp"
            android:viewportWidth="24"
            android:viewportHeight="24">
            <group
                android:pivotX="12"
                android:pivotY="12"
                android:scaleX="0.6"
                android:scaleY="0.6">
                <group
                    android:name="bg"
                    android:pivotX="12"
                    android:pivotY="12">
                    <!-- Plain circle, same role as Echo's own "bg" -
                         a soft duplicate spinning underneath everything,
                         not the scalloped badge shape itself. -->
                    <!-- Circle radius 6.348 - deliberately kept BELOW
                       the badge's minimum radius (6.683, the depth of
                       its innermost scallop notch), with a ~5% safety
                       margin, not just below its maximum radius (8.14,
                       the outermost scallop tip). A radius between
                       those two numbers (which an earlier version used)
                       stays hidden at the tips but pokes out through
                       the scallop valleys - confirmed by rendering the
                       bg circle in isolation against the badge outline
                       and finding it peeked through at two points
                       before this correction. -->
                    <path android:pathData="M 12 5.652 C 15.506 5.652 18.348 8.494 18.348 12.000 C 18.348 15.506 15.506 18.348 12.000 18.348 C 8.494 18.348 5.652 15.506 5.652 12.000 C 5.652 8.494 8.494 5.652 12.000 5.652 Z">
                        <aapt:attr name="android:fillColor">
                            <gradient
                                android:centerX="7"
                                android:centerY="7"
                                android:gradientRadius="16"
                                android:type="radial">
                                <item android:color="#F0A7C6" android:offset="0" />
                                <item android:color="#5C7FE0" android:offset="1" />
                            </gradient>
                        </aapt:attr>
                    </path>
                </group>
                <group
                    android:name="note_group"
                    android:pivotX="12"
                    android:pivotY="12">
                    <!-- Same role as Echo's "play" group: rotation +
                         translateY wobble on the wrapper, independent
                         of the pathData morph on the path inside it. -->
                    <!-- Color fixed to white: the previous #16191C is a
                         near-black that has essentially zero contrast
                         against this app's splash background (#050508,
                         also near-black) — confirmed by user screenshot
                         showing the note invisible. Echo Nightly's own
                         #1d1d1b note works fine because Echo's own splash
                         background (amoled_bg) actually resolves to
                         @color/white, not black — same near-black icon
                         color, opposite (light) background. Aurum's real
                         background is dark, so the note needs to be
                         light, matching the real logo's own white note
                         in scallop_ring.png. -->
                    <path
                        android:name="note"
                        android:fillColor="#FFFFFF"
                        android:pathData="M 12.284 9.324 L 12.667 9.357 L 13.043 9.439 L 13.405 9.570 L 13.746 9.747 L 14.062 9.967 L 14.346 10.226 L 14.594 10.520 L 14.801 10.844 L 14.964 11.192 L 15.081 11.559 L 15.148 11.937 L 15.166 12.322 L 15.133 12.705 L 15.050 13.080 L 14.920 13.442 L 14.743 13.784 L 14.523 14.099 L 14.264 14.383 L 13.970 14.631 L 13.646 14.838 L 13.297 15.002 L 12.931 15.118 L 12.552 15.186 L 12.168 15.203 L 11.785 15.170 L 11.409 15.088 L 11.048 14.957 L 10.706 14.780 L 10.391 14.560 L 10.107 14.301 L 9.859 14.007 L 9.651 13.683 L 9.488 13.335 L 9.372 12.968 L 9.304 12.590 L 9.287 12.206 L 9.319 11.822 L 9.402 11.447 L 9.533 11.085 L 9.709 10.744 L 9.929 10.428 L 10.189 10.144 L 10.483 9.896 L 10.807 9.689 L 11.155 9.526 L 11.521 9.409 L 11.900 9.342 Z" />
                </group>
                <group
                    android:name="ring"
                    android:pivotX="12"
                    android:pivotY="12">
                    <!-- Aurum's real scallop badge silhouette. -->
                    <path
                        android:name="ring_path"
                        android:pathData="M 11.546 3.850 L 11.060 4.079 L 10.641 4.398 L 10.282 4.799 L 9.865 5.125 L 9.346 5.198 L 8.820 5.106 L 8.292 5.133 L 7.772 5.252 L 7.292 5.493 L 6.897 5.857 L 6.553 6.267 L 6.335 6.757 L 6.281 7.284 L 6.281 7.821 L 6.200 8.347 L 5.861 8.760 L 5.398 9.032 L 4.996 9.378 L 4.662 9.795 L 4.467 10.296 L 4.367 10.818 L 4.386 11.348 L 4.556 11.858 L 4.811 12.321 L 5.146 12.741 L 5.312 13.240 L 5.224 13.756 L 5.029 14.255 L 4.933 14.779 L 4.984 15.309 L 5.135 15.825 L 5.416 16.282 L 5.789 16.667 L 6.237 16.963 L 6.756 17.091 L 7.255 17.268 L 7.615 17.650 L 7.820 18.147 L 8.136 18.573 L 8.527 18.937 L 9.021 19.140 L 9.538 19.266 L 10.075 19.266 L 10.559 19.458 L 10.954 19.819 L 11.424 20.076 L 11.953 20.150 L 12.476 20.079 L 12.973 19.874 L 13.388 19.536 L 13.840 19.300 L 14.377 19.277 L 14.901 19.186 L 15.411 19.016 L 15.821 18.670 L 16.153 18.257 L 16.388 17.777 L 16.680 17.339 L 17.160 17.123 L 17.681 16.998 L 18.138 16.724 L 18.531 16.357 L 18.834 15.921 L 18.996 15.414 L 19.076 14.886 L 19.017 14.355 L 18.821 13.855 L 18.664 13.347 L 18.787 12.831 L 19.131 12.419 L 19.409 11.964 L 19.610 11.468 L 19.633 10.933 L 19.588 10.403 L 19.402 9.902 L 19.111 9.450 L 18.723 9.080 L 18.270 8.797 L 17.868 8.446 L 17.745 7.933 L 17.768 7.396 L 17.708 6.868 L 17.529 6.366 L 17.213 5.937 L 16.832 5.556 L 16.369 5.293 L 15.863 5.119 L 15.332 5.071 L 14.810 5.179 L 14.275 5.198 L 13.820 4.935 L 13.460 4.536 L 13.088 4.152 L 12.614 3.906 L 12.083 3.850 Z">
                        <aapt:attr name="android:fillColor">
                            <gradient
                                android:startX="4"
                                android:startY="4"
                                android:endX="20"
                                android:endY="20"
                                android:type="linear">
                                <item android:color="#F0A7C6" android:offset="0" />
                                <item android:color="#8B7FD6" android:offset="0.5" />
                                <item android:color="#5C7FE0" android:offset="1" />
                            </gradient>
                        </aapt:attr>
                    </path>
                </group>
            </group>
        </vector>
    </aapt:attr>

    <!-- ring: identical timing to Echo's own "ring" target - two
         back-to-back 1200ms bursts, net 240° rotation. -->
    <target android:name="ring">
        <aapt:attr name="android:animation">
            <set>
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="450"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="rotation"
                    android:valueFrom="0"
                    android:valueTo="120"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="450"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="rotation"
                    android:startOffset="450"
                    android:valueFrom="120"
                    android:valueTo="240"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
            </set>
        </aapt:attr>
    </target>

    <!-- note: play-triangle morphs into Aurum's real note shape.
         Same start offset/duration as Echo's own first "note" morph
         (200ms offset, 400ms duration) - but no reverse morph at
         1600ms, since the goal is to land on and stay on the real
         logo, not snap back to the triangle placeholder. -->
    <target android:name="note">
        <aapt:attr name="android:animation">
            <objectAnimator
                android:duration="150"
                android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                android:propertyName="pathData"
                android:startOffset="75"
                android:valueFrom="M 12.284 9.324 L 12.667 9.357 L 13.043 9.439 L 13.405 9.570 L 13.746 9.747 L 14.062 9.967 L 14.346 10.226 L 14.594 10.520 L 14.801 10.844 L 14.964 11.192 L 15.081 11.559 L 15.148 11.937 L 15.166 12.322 L 15.133 12.705 L 15.050 13.080 L 14.920 13.442 L 14.743 13.784 L 14.523 14.099 L 14.264 14.383 L 13.970 14.631 L 13.646 14.838 L 13.297 15.002 L 12.931 15.118 L 12.552 15.186 L 12.168 15.203 L 11.785 15.170 L 11.409 15.088 L 11.048 14.957 L 10.706 14.780 L 10.391 14.560 L 10.107 14.301 L 9.859 14.007 L 9.651 13.683 L 9.488 13.335 L 9.372 12.968 L 9.304 12.590 L 9.287 12.206 L 9.319 11.822 L 9.402 11.447 L 9.533 11.085 L 9.709 10.744 L 9.929 10.428 L 10.189 10.144 L 10.483 9.896 L 10.807 9.689 L 11.155 9.526 L 11.521 9.409 L 11.900 9.342 Z"
                android:valueTo="M 12.304 8.315 L 12.763 8.594 L 13.212 8.880 L 13.662 9.167 L 14.105 9.452 L 14.561 9.731 L 15.026 9.994 L 15.370 10.385 L 15.421 10.908 L 15.421 11.450 L 15.158 11.853 L 14.671 11.681 L 14.216 11.413 L 13.749 11.143 L 13.303 10.884 L 13.189 11.336 L 13.189 11.878 L 13.189 12.419 L 13.189 12.961 L 13.189 13.503 L 13.189 14.045 L 13.118 14.562 L 12.958 15.051 L 12.664 15.493 L 12.269 15.847 L 11.805 16.107 L 11.300 16.233 L 10.759 16.233 L 10.260 16.085 L 9.799 15.834 L 9.416 15.451 L 9.156 15.002 L 8.977 14.506 L 8.935 13.982 L 9.031 13.476 L 9.229 12.990 L 9.564 12.571 L 9.987 12.249 L 10.453 12.021 L 10.959 11.937 L 11.488 11.992 L 11.799 11.772 L 11.799 11.230 L 11.799 10.688 L 11.799 10.147 L 11.799 9.605 L 11.799 9.063 L 11.857 8.535 Z"
                android:valueType="pathType" />
        </aapt:attr>
    </target>

    <!-- note_group: same rotation+translateY wobble timing as Echo's
         "play" target (400ms offset rotate out, hold, 1700ms offset
         rotate back) - the triangle-shaped note tilts as it morphs,
         then settles back level once it's the real note shape. -->
    <target android:name="note_group">
        <aapt:attr name="android:animation">
            <set>
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="150"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="rotation"
                    android:startOffset="150"
                    android:valueFrom="0"
                    android:valueTo="-52"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="150"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="translateY"
                    android:startOffset="150"
                    android:valueFrom="0"
                    android:valueTo="2"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="112"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="rotation"
                    android:startOffset="638"
                    android:valueFrom="-52"
                    android:valueTo="0"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="112"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="translateY"
                    android:startOffset="638"
                    android:valueFrom="2"
                    android:valueTo="0"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <!-- scale-pulse, same role as Echo's "media" target -->
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="112"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="scaleX"
                    android:startOffset="262"
                    android:valueFrom="1"
                    android:valueTo="1.05"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="112"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="scaleY"
                    android:startOffset="262"
                    android:valueFrom="1"
                    android:valueTo="1.05"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="75"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="scaleX"
                    android:startOffset="375"
                    android:valueFrom="1.05"
                    android:valueTo="1"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="75"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="scaleY"
                    android:startOffset="375"
                    android:valueFrom="1.05"
                    android:valueTo="1"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="112"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="scaleY"
                    android:startOffset="638"
                    android:valueFrom="1"
                    android:valueTo="1.05"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="113"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="scaleX"
                    android:startOffset="638"
                    android:valueFrom="1"
                    android:valueTo="1.05"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="75"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="scaleX"
                    android:startOffset="750"
                    android:valueFrom="1.05"
                    android:valueTo="1"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="75"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/fast_out_slow_in"
                    android:propertyName="scaleY"
                    android:startOffset="750"
                    android:valueFrom="1.05"
                    android:valueTo="1"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
            </set>
        </aapt:attr>
    </target>

    <!-- bg: compressed to 900ms (was 2400ms — see file header note on
         why the whole timeline was rescaled by 0.375x). Same full-turn
         spin role as Echo's own "bg" target. -->
    <target android:name="bg">
        <aapt:attr name="android:animation">
            <set>
                <objectAnimator
                    android:duration="900"
                    android:interpolator="@android:interpolator/anticipate_overshoot"
                    android:propertyName="rotation"
                    android:valueFrom="0"
                    android:valueTo="360"
                    android:valueType="floatType" />
            </set>
        </aapt:attr>
    </target>
</animated-vector>
